2b:["$","li","Applicants will provide accurate information on the online application form; those who provide false information will have their applications rejected and legal action taken against them.",{"children":"Applicants will provide accurate information on the online application form; those who provide false information will have their applications rejected and legal action taken against them."}]
2c:["$","li","PhD Programs are also eligible for the program.",{"children":"PhD Programs are also eligible for the program."}]
